WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Name your session and create it in Game LAN.

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
Select a friend and choose Invite.

00:06.000 --> 00:08.000
Your friend sees the session name and chooses Accept.

00:08.000 --> 00:10.250
Both players appear in the participant list.

00:10.250 --> 00:14.250
Chat is ready. To play, each person enables their game network.
